{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01951","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 花飞桃李蹊 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 花飞桃李蹊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远期难可托，桃李自依依。\n花径无容迹，戎裘未下机。\n随风开又落，度日扫还飞。\n欲折枝枝赠，那知归不归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}